 'crs-reporting-in-turkey-turkish-citizenship-by-investment-what-investors-should-know':{tr:'Türkiye’de CRS Bildirimi ve Yatırım Yoluyla Türk Vatandaşlığı',zh:'土耳其 CRS 信息申报与投资入籍：投资者须知'},
